Patches origin
--------------

For out-of-tree device support, patches were imported from the following
community-maintained kernel forks:
  * sdm845: https://gitlab.com/sdm845-mainline/linux

Those patchsets were last synced on the following dates:
  * sdm845: 2025-02-14

Following patches were backported from the sdm845/6.13-release branch of the
sdm845-mainline repository:
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0128-arm64-dts-qcom-sdm845-oneplus-use-guard-pages.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0129-media-qcom-camss-csiphy-3ph-Add-Gen2-v1.1-MIPI-CSI-2-CPHY-init.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0130-media-qcom-camss-Add-sdm845-c-phy-basic-support.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0131-media-qcom-camss-Prepare-CSID-for-C-PHY-support.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0132-media-i2c-Add-imx371-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0133-media-i2c-Add-imx376-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0134-media-i2c-Add-imx519-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0135-arm64-dts-qcom-sdm845-oneplus-camera-bringup.patch
  (following 6 come from https://gitlab.com/sdm845-mainline/linux/-/merge_requests/113)
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0136-fixup!-media-i2c-Add-imx371-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0137-fixup!-media-i2c-Add-imx376-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0138-fixup!-media-i2c-Add-imx519-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0139-fixup!-arm64-dts-qcom-sdm845-oneplus-camera-bringup.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0140-fixup-media-i2c-Add-imx371-image-sensor-driver.patch
  * debian/patches/sdm845/0141-fixup-media-i2c-Add-imx376-image-sensor-driver.patch

